window.docContents[55].resolve({"/Basic-Types/Maps-and-Sets/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Maps-and-Sets--Library-Design":{"contents":"All the basic operations on maps and sets are fully verified.\nThey are proven correct with respect to simpler models implemented with lists.\nAt the same time, maps and sets have predictable performance.\n\nSome types include additional operations that are not yet fully verified.\nThese operations are useful, and not all programs need full verification.\nExamples include HashMap.partition and TreeMap.filterMap.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Basic Types\u0009Maps and Sets","header":"20.19.1. Library Design","id":"/Basic-Types/Maps-and-Sets/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Maps-and-Sets--Library-Design"},"/Basic-Types/Strings/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Strings--API-Reference--Raw-Substrings--Properties":{"contents":"Checks whether a substring is empty.A substring is empty if its start and end positions are the same.\n\nThe number of bytes used by the string's UTF-8 encoding.\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Basic Types\u0009Strings\u0009API Reference\u0009Raw Substrings","header":"20.8.4.12.1. Properties","id":"/Basic-Types/Strings/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Strings--API-Reference--Raw-Substrings--Properties"},"/Run-Time-Code/Boxing/#boxing":{"contents":"Lean 值在运行时可以用两种方式表示：* 装箱值可能是指向堆中值的指针，也可能需要通过移位和掩码才能取得。* 非装箱值可以直接取得。\n\n装箱值要么是指向对象的指针，此时最低位为 0；要么是立即值，此时最低位为 1，将其表示右移一位即可得到该值。\n\n采用非装箱表示的类型（例如 UInt8 和枚举归纳类型），在编译器能够确定值具有相应类型的上下文中，会表示为对应的 C 类型。\n在某些上下文中（例如 Array 这样的泛型容器类型），原本采用非装箱表示的值必须先装箱才能存储。\n换言之，由于枚举归纳类型 Bool 采用非装箱表示，调用 Bool.not 时传入和返回的都是非装箱的 uint8_t 值；但 Array Bool 中的各个 Bool 值则是装箱的。\n归纳类型构造器中类型为 Bool 的字段采用非装箱表示，而多态字段实例化为 Bool 后，其中存储的 Bool 则采用装箱表示。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009运行时代码","header":"12.1. 装箱","id":"/Run-Time-Code/Boxing/#boxing"},"/releases/v4.29.0/#Lean-__________________--Release-Notes--Lean-4___29___0-_LPAR_2026-03-27_RPAR_--Highlights--mvcgen___-Specifications-in-the-Local-Context":{"contents":"#12395 adds mvcgen\nsupport for specifications in the local context. Example:\n\nimport Std.Tactic.Do\n\nopen Std.Do\n\nset_option mvcgen.warning false\n\ndef foo (x : Id Nat → Id Nat) : Id Nat := do\n  let r₁ ← x (pure 42)\n  let r₂ ← x (pure 26)\n  pure (r₁ + r₂)\n\ntheorem foo_spec\n    (x : Id Nat → Id Nat)\n    (x_spec : ∀ (k : Id Nat) (_ : ⦃⌜True⌝⦄ k ⦃⇓r => ⌜r % 2 = 0⌝⦄), ⦃⌜True⌝⦄ x k ⦃⇓r => ⌜r % 2 = 0⌝⦄) :\n    ⦃⌜True⌝⦄ foo x ⦃⇓r => ⌜r % 2 = 0⌝⦄ := by\n  mvcgen [foo, x_spec] <;> grind\n\ndef bar (k : Id Nat) : Id Nat := do\n  let r ← k\n  if r > 30 then return 12 else return r\n\nexample : ⦃⌜True⌝⦄ foo bar ⦃⇓r => ⌜r % 2 = 0⌝⦄ := by\n  mvcgen [foo_spec, bar] -- unfold `bar` and automatically apply the spec for the higher-order argument `k`\n\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Release Notes\u0009Lean 4.29.0 (2026-03-27)\u0009Highlights","header":"mvcgen: Specifications in the Local Context","id":"/releases/v4.29.0/#Lean-__________________--Release-Notes--Lean-4___29___0-_LPAR_2026-03-27_RPAR_--Highlights--mvcgen___-Specifications-in-the-Local-Context"}});